sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as Web UI
  participant API as Node.js API
  participant Auth as Auth Service
  participant DB as SQLite Database
  User->>UI: Enter credentials
  UI->>API: POST /api/auth/login
  API->>DB: Find active user by email
  DB-->>API: User + salted hash
  API->>Auth: verifyPassword()
  Auth-->>API: valid
  API->>DB: Store hashed session token
  API-->>UI: Token + public user data
  User->>UI: Add expense
  UI->>API: POST /api/expenses (Bearer token)
  API->>DB: Validate session and insert expense
  DB-->>API: New expense record
  API-->>UI: Updated record
